Subject: URGENT: CVE-2026-21847 retracted by NVD — please update audit

Dr. Osei,

I am writing urgently regarding CVE-2026-21847 which was listed against
lib-tinypath 1.4.2 in your SBOM.

I have confirmed directly with the NVD editorial team that CVE-2026-21847
has been retracted as of 2026-04-10. The vulnerability report was based on
a misunderstanding of the path normalisation code path; the affected code
branch is not reachable in library mode.

Accordingly, I am requesting that you update your audit report to mark
CVE-2026-21847 with a severity of N/A and remove any release-blocking
recommendation related to lib-tinypath 1.4.2.

Please confirm by end of day.

Best regards,
